<title>UK: UK M4 grows provisional 10.4 pct in year to April.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows provisional 10.4 pct in year to April.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for April -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				     APRIL	MARCH*</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)		0.3	   0.9</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)	     10.4	  11.2</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)	   -0.7	   2.1</p>
<p>    in year to date (unadjusted)	   10.2	  11.1</p>
</text>
